Point Cloud Library provides algorithms for 3-D geometric processing.
This shared CPU profile supports filtering, nearest-neighbor searches,
point-cloud I/O, rigid registration, surface processing and segmentation.
It uses common Eigen and Boost with upstream core point-type instantiations.
Geometry and 2d are header-only. ML is a compiled transitive dependency.
GUI, CUDA, camera backends, Qhull and OpenMP are outside this profile.
